      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUDGEREE (4) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (23.37) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Has ability and can bounce back. TROPHY DARTS (1) has been out of the placings last two but prior to that produced a swift 19.62 win over 342m at Angle Park. Top win three back and can measure up again. BLACK XENA (2) had some strong recent form but was below best last time when sixth (23.19) in a OPEN at this track. Generally fast to begin but was always well back despite the low draw last time. Can do much better this time. PAW MANTRA (8) pinged the lids and wasn't headed last time. Right in the mix again.",
